#chip 16F886, 8

'Repeat For test (Change 1654): Wait 1 s inside a 5 s loop (within the 8,000,000 cycle limit for an inline Wait at this clock)
'Expect: compiles, and the whole Repeat For construct runs exactly 10,000,000 clock cycles
'(checked by simulating the generated assembly instruction by instruction)

#option explicit

Repeat for 5 s
    Wait 1 s
    PORTA = !PORTA
End Repeat
Do
Loop
